1
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:14,760
Greetings and welcome to this massive open online course Introduction to Biarisk Management.

2
00:00:14,760 --> 00:00:20,260
This MOOC is being brought to you by University Malaysia Sabah in collaboration with the Commonwealth

3
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:21,800
of Learning.

4
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:28,240
I am your instructor Kenneth Rodriguez and I will be guiding you over this 5 week course.

5
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:32,680
This MOOC will be conducted over a period of 5 weeks.

6
00:00:32,680 --> 00:00:37,080
These will include 4 weeks of instruction and 1 week of assessment.

7
00:00:37,080 --> 00:00:45,760
The first week of this MOOC will focus on the principles and practices of biarisk management.

8
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:51,960
I will be introducing you to the key concepts of biarisk management as well as to the concepts

9
00:00:51,960 --> 00:00:56,600
of biological agents and risk groups.

10
00:00:56,600 --> 00:01:02,840
I will also introduce you to the organizational structure of a biarisk management facility.

11
00:01:02,840 --> 00:01:07,800
The second week of this MOOC will focus on risk assessment.

12
00:01:07,800 --> 00:01:13,980
I will introduce you to the concept of hazard and risk and take you through the process

13
00:01:13,980 --> 00:01:20,920
of conducting a thorough risk assessment for a biological agent.

14
00:01:20,920 --> 00:01:26,440
The third week of this MOOC will focus on risk mitigation.

15
00:01:26,440 --> 00:01:32,920
We will learn how to apply the 5 controls to mitigate or reduce the risk posed by biological

16
00:01:32,920 --> 00:01:35,080
agents.

17
00:01:35,080 --> 00:01:39,600
The fourth week of this MOOC will focus on performance assessment.

18
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:45,160
We will learn how to assess the performance of our biarisk management protocols in order

19
00:01:45,160 --> 00:01:52,300
to define and determine whether they are in proper working order.

20
00:01:52,300 --> 00:02:01,950
Finally, in the fifth week of this course, you will be assessed based on a case study.

21
00:02:01,950 --> 00:02:10,980
Participants who successfully complete this course will be awarded a certificate of completion.

22
00:02:10,980 --> 00:02:15,500
Thank you for your participation in this MOOC introduction.

23
00:02:15,500 --> 00:02:20,060
I look forward to your participation in the course and wish you a pleasant learning experience.
